  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-first-ballet-class-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "98d72f0786fa53795aec48ab4a42f3711bc37d67fb6ed59d55b7e3927eff69b4",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3d7d32455fc81dc6974ab7f0745465c3a7a45efd6b2037ed79b525ec4fff89fd",
      "text": "玉兔的\n第一堂芭蕾课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c37912e65546f606b036351afa623371466156dc733ed438025ec5b1a01f8b7",
      "text": "玉兔来上芭蕾课啦。\n“我要跳舞！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "778fa2dfc80c4bdfcbfff6c5dc8998dda86c4501ac01fefbb54fb8dfa8eb6c82",
      "text": "软软的舞鞋，绿绿的小裙子。\n“我的耳朵也准备好啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b9918a9ca7605efd4fc7049652d405197b46bd6733c4727504e4cb360d6fafa",
      "text": "音乐响了。\n“跟着我，小步走。”\n一步，一步，又一步。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2bf14a58c4899ae2d010aad9bdf4764063b23c12876c9281d537e13c8d27067a",
      "text": "玉兔一高兴，蹦了起来。\n“哎呀，怎么又蹦起来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "258af1dc022fff9d76ed95821b64f4ed9e1d60749a1783cf81a3ec7d852d3248",
      "text": "“步子小一点。”\n玉兔跟着嫦娥，轻轻走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96fd41e7520990029d2fe214153f434e9f45a834e8e5ee37c0aa1f98ef7a8db5",
      "text": "慢一点，轻一点。\n两人踩着节拍往前走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8cb6d7605454d1fb7cab32b418a3aedcc5ff273310f0af72885b15c7aa0e932e",
      "text": "音乐停了，玉兔也停了。\n咦？\n两只耳朵还在晃！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "591b52bc2f221fd4c63a435ea6c2f6624a983cbf050b7b5766eb26ab196ab480",
      "text": "“现在，慢慢转个身。”\n玉兔小步挪着，转了过去。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a2b818b47244642bbe0bb2ad9c03565190c76dbabcb27842561117adb1a5c2",
      "text": "嫦娥转着转着，转反啦。\n“咦，玉兔，咱俩面对面啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e0e5e3d4c526efc9bc07c0830b3b7f17c3ac93d0d8a45bfab9c884f2cb1a1466",
      "text": "两人扑哧一笑，又站好了。\n“小步走，慢慢转。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dcbddf1b04a10935d1b873183f1a1615fddac6f68389012de393775947de7ceb",
      "text": "玉兔听着节拍。\n小步走，慢慢转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f9b8810262677ec44335a1cf896264658d4064f84592ab656031a80aa9a067d",
      "text": "“停！”\n两个小伙伴站稳啦。\n两只长耳朵，晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "77fa0bf7b2072873592f034eaa4a53e9082937f8ba210a8f1dcb0c59a6a8f4ab",
      "text": "“连起来跳一遍吧！”\n小步走，慢慢转——\n停！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94815faf6785fec63e3eb8f5345361b456f217616a1f7c68d8720684bae6a1ac",
      "text": "“我们跳完啦！”\n嫦娥笑着拍拍手。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df6aafa4a40f8f6640c3fb8452a8878801b9f3e3f717b83a23f5a92f2c2ce549",
      "text": "玉兔轻轻鞠个躬。\n两只耳朵，也跟着点点头。\n“再跳一遍，好不好？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
